      "correct": "Can you do me a favor?",
      "note": "With **favor**, the verb is **do**, not **make**."
    },
    {
      "incorrect": "I'm in favor to the plan.",
      "correct": "I'm in favor of the plan.",
      "note": "The phrase is **in favor of**."
    }
  ],
